## Usage

1. Import fonts in your HTML:
```html
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&family=JetBrains+Mono&family=Merriweather:wght@400;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
```

2. Use in your CSS:
```css
:root {
  /* Sans-serif */
  --font-primary: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;
  --font-secondary: 'Montserrat', 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;
  
  /* Serif */
  --font-serif: 'Merriweather', Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;
  
  /* Monospace */
  --font-mono: 'JetBrains Mono', 'Fira Code', Consolas, monospace;
  
  /* Display */
  --font-display: 'Oswald', Impact, sans-serif;
}

/* Usage */
body {
  font-family: var(--font-primary);
}

code {
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
}

h1 {
  font-family: var(--font-display);
}
``` 